[
  {
    "text": "What if moving Cook Inlet power",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 2.49,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "means moving the computer instead?",
    "start": 2.52,
    "end": 5.32,
    "seg": 0
  },
  {
    "text": "Deep Green proposes sixty-six compute",
    "start": 6.42,
    "end": 9.81,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "hives near Nikiski.",
    "start": 9.84,
    "end": 11.46,
    "seg": 1
  },
  {
    "text": "Around them, three hundred thirty",
    "start": 12.3,
    "end": 14.290000000000001,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "to three hundred fifty marine hydrokinetic",
    "start": 14.32,
    "end": 18.29,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "turbines.",
    "start": 18.32,
    "end": 19.02,
    "seg": 2
  },
  {
    "text": "The turbines would power them directly",
    "start": 19.88,
    "end": 22.15,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "while seawater provides passive",
    "start": 22.18,
    "end": 24.41,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "cooling.",
    "start": 24.44,
    "end": 25.14,
    "seg": 3
  },
  {
    "text": "Clever.",
    "start": 25.68,
    "end": 26.209999999999997,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "Put the primary load beside its",
    "start": 26.24,
    "end": 29.41,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "proposed power source.",
    "start": 29.44,
    "end": 30.52,
    "seg": 4
  },
  {
    "text": "A three point five mile cable",
    "start": 31.6,
    "end": 34.129999999999995,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "would carry power and fiber ashore.",
    "start": 34.16,
    "end": 36.72,
    "seg": 5
  },
  {
    "text": "The notice estimates one hundred",
    "start": 38.06,
    "end": 40.269999999999996,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "megawatts.",
    "start": 40.3,
    "end": 41.24,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "Where would it go?",
    "start": 42.1,
    "end": 42.800000000000004,
    "seg": 6
  },
  {
    "text": "The data center would be the",
    "start": 44.08,
    "end": 45.65,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "primary use.",
    "start": 45.68,
    "end": 46.56,
    "seg": 7
  },
  {
    "text": "Only spare power could reach the",
    "start": 47.62,
    "end": 49.65,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "Railbelt.",
    "start": 49.68,
    "end": 50.38,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "Could, not will.",
    "start": 50.92,
    "end": 53.14,
    "seg": 8
  },
  {
    "text": "Now put that diagram on a",
    "start": 54.12,
    "end": 56.67,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "test bench.",
    "start": 56.7,
    "end": 57.400000000000006,
    "seg": 9
  },
  {
    "text": "The filing names no customer or",
    "start": 58.3,
    "end": 60.83,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "committed financing.",
    "start": 60.86,
    "end": 61.82,
    "seg": 10
  },
  {
    "text": "No completed proof covers output,",
    "start": 62.9,
    "end": 65.5,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "cooling, economics, grid connection,",
    "start": 66.04,
    "end": 68.52,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "or environmental effects.",
    "start": 68.94,
    "end": 70.06,
    "seg": 11
  },
  {
    "text": "That doesn't make it bad.",
    "start": 70.9,
    "end": 72.2,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "It makes the next step a",
    "start": 72.74,
    "end": 74.31,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "study.",
    "start": 74.34,
    "end": 75.04,
    "seg": 12
  },
  {
    "text": "On September fourth, F E R",
    "start": 75.9,
    "end": 77.905,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "C opened public comment on the",
    "start": 77.935,
    "end": 79.47,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "application.",
    "start": 79.5,
    "end": 79.91,
    "seg": 13
  },
  {
    "text": "If issued, the permit gives study",
    "start": 79.94,
    "end": 83.35,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "priority.",
    "start": 83.38,
    "end": 84.08,
    "seg": 14
  },
  {
    "text": "It wouldn't authorize construction",
    "start": 85.02,
    "end": 86.49,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "or prove that one turbine works",
    "start": 86.52,
    "end": 88.91,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "there.",
    "start": 88.94,
    "end": 89.64,
    "seg": 15
  },
  {
    "text": "Comments and competing applications",
    "start": 90.28,
    "end": 92.35,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "are due November second at one",
    "start": 92.38,
    "end": 94.343,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "P M Alaska time.",
    "start": 94.373,
    "end": 95.64,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "Brief comments need no prior registration.",
    "start": 96.44,
    "end": 98.74,
    "seg": 16
  },
  {
    "text": "So stop the cable one inch",
    "start": 99.96,
    "end": 102.19,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "short of victory.",
    "start": 102.22,
    "end": 102.96,
    "seg": 17
  },
  {
    "text": "Bringing compute to Cook Inlet's",
    "start": 103.9,
    "end": 105.95,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "energy is the clever part.",
    "start": 105.98,
    "end": 107.51,
    "seg": 18
  },
  {
    "text": "It becomes an Alaska win when",
    "start": 107.54,
    "end": 110.69,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "studies prove engineering, grid,",
    "start": 110.72,
    "end": 112.8,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "economics, and environmental effects.",
    "start": 113.28,
    "end": 115.22,
    "seg": 19
  },
  {
    "text": "What would you require?",
    "start": 116.04,
    "end": 117.26,
    "seg": 19
  }
